  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Moisture Wicking Long Sleeve Shirts are designed for versatility and comfort. Crafted with high-performance materials, they offer moisture-wicking properties to keep you dry and cool under pressure. The soft and breathable fabric ensures all-day comfort, while the double-needle stitched collar adds durability. Sized to government specs, these shirts serve as an ideal base layer beneath your military uniform, tactical vest, or jacket. They're also great for standalone wear, offering a classic style suitable for various occasions.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
